
  SeedSigner OS -- DEVELOPMENT IMAGE (not for real funds)

  * seedsigner start|stop|restart|status   control the app (no manual killing)
  * ssh root@seedsigner.local    reachable by name over usb/wifi/ethernet (mdns)
  * network-info                 show interfaces / IP addresses
  * usb relay                    ssh root@10.55.0.1 (static, no host config
                                 needed) unless host is internet-sharing
  * /mnt/data                    persistent 256MB ext4 scratch partition
  * /mnt/data/seedsigner/src     app auto-runs from here if it exists,
                                 otherwise from the baked-in /opt/src
  * /mnt/microsd                 boot (FAT) partition; put wifi.txt or
                                 wpa_supplicant.conf or authorized_keys here
  * tools: git rsync scp ssh vi nano pip (installs to RAM; use /mnt/data
                                 or a venv to persist -- see docs)

